          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content15\" group=\"Content\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Content Width\" name=\"contentWidth\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"12\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Wrap Bg\" name=\"wrapBgColor\" value=\"#f7f7f7\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background8.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#f7f7f7\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background13-5.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.3\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"card col-md-12 col-lg-{{contentWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\">\n                            <b>Create Site Now</b><br><b>bgg</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>1. Supports Natural Prostate Function:</b> Prosta Peak contains botanical ingredients such as Saw Palmetto and Pygeum, which are commonly included in prostate health supplements. These ingredients are intended to complement normal prostate function, although research on their benefits remains mixed.<br><br><b>2. Helps Maintain Urinary Comfort:</b> Healthy urinary function is an important part of daily well-being. Prosta Peak is designed to complement a healthy routine focused on urinary comfort and normal bladder function. Individual results may vary, and the supplement is not intended to treat urinary disorders.<br><br><b>3. Delivers Antioxidant Support:</b> Green Tea contains naturally occurring antioxidant compounds called polyphenols. These compounds help protect cells from oxidative stress and contribute to the body's normal protective processes.<br><br><b>4. Complements Healthy Aging:</b> A balanced approach to wellness includes proper nutrition, regular physical activity, adequate hydration, and consistent self-care. Prosta Peak is designed to complement these habits as part of a broader approach to maintaining wellness with age.<br><br><b>5. Offers Convenient Daily Support:</b> Prosta Peak comes in capsule form, making it easy to incorporate into a regular wellness routine. Following the product label and maintaining healthy lifestyle habits can help support a consistent approach to personal wellness.<br></p>\n                        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Start\n                                Now</a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
